# Security headers served by Netlify for every path.
#
# script-src is 'self' plus exactly TWO hosts, and each one had to be argued for:
#   googletagmanager.com — gtag.js, for the optional GA4 tag the owner controls
#                          from Admin → Analytics → Google Analytics,
#   connect.facebook.net — fbevents.js, for the optional Meta Pixel controlled
#                          from Admin → Analytics → Meta Pixel.
# Nothing else may be added. Widening script-src is the single most costly
# relaxation in this policy, and it stays an explicit allowlist rather than a
# blanket https: precisely so the next addition has to be argued for. There is
# still no 'unsafe-inline' and no 'unsafe-eval' — the Vite bundle has no inline
# scripts, and neither tag needs either: both install snippets are written out in
# TypeScript (src/lib/ga.ts, src/lib/meta.ts) rather than injected as inline
# script, which is exactly what keeps that promise affordable. The shop's own
# analytics remain first-party (src/lib/analytics.ts posts to our own API) and
# need no script host at all. Inline styles + Google Fonts stay allowed so the
# site renders unchanged.
#
# frame-src must be listed explicitly: without it, embedded frames fall back to
# default-src 'self' and every video the studio rail plays through an embed
# (Admin → Content → Videos accepts YouTube/Vimeo/Instagram URLs, which
# toEmbedUrl rewrites to these three hosts) is blocked in production while
# working fine in dev, where no CSP is served. Kept to the exact hosts
# toEmbedUrl can emit rather than a blanket https:. Covered by src/lib/csp.test.ts.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://connect.facebook.net; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; media-src 'self' blob: https:; connect-src 'self' https:; frame-src https://www.youtube.com https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://player.vimeo.com https://www.instagram.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
